  "description": "So-Hwa is a red fox with white hair, separated from her family and living alone in the mountains. One day, she comes across Do-Hwi, an injured and abandoned wild cat, and decides to take care of him. But little does she know that Do-Hwi is actually a fearsome tiger, reborn after a thousand years of life. Do-Hwi conceals his identity well, but as the years go by, he matures into quite the hunk and grows more and more attached to the beautiful fox. So-Hwa grows suspicious amidst frightening dreams of being chased by a tiger, not to mention making steamy hot love with him, and their relationship is about to take a drastic turn... for better or worse.\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
